<details><summary>Solution</summary>We will label the vertices and sides clockwise starting with the topmost point  $ a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i$  and  $ j$  such that  $ a + b + c = c + d + e = e + f + g = g + h + i = i + j + a$  as shown:[asy]import olympiad;
