&=[x^n]\sum_{j=0}^\infty\prod_{i=0}^\infty\binom kjx^{2^ij}
&=[x^n]\prod_{i=0}^\infty\sum_{j=0}^\infty\binom kj\left(x^{2^i}\right)^j
