&= \frac{\frac{bd-ac}{abcd}}{\frac{bd+ac-cd-ab}{abcd}}
&= -\left(\frac{ac-bd}{ac+bd-ab-cd}\right)
&= -\left(\frac{m_1-m_2}{e-f}\right)
\end{align*}
which implies that  $\frac{m_1-m_2}{e-f}\in i\mathbb{R}$  and thus  $EF \perp M_1M_2$  which was the required conclusion.

