\[ [PAF]+[PBD]+[PCE]=\frac{1}{2}[ABC]  \]
if and only if  $P$  lies on at least one of the medians of triangle  $ABC$ . (Here  $[XYZ]$  denotes the area of triangle  $XYZ$ .)

