<details><summary>Solution C</summary>Let  $(BCY)$  meet  $\overline{AB}$  again at  $W$  and let  $(ADX)$  meet  $\overline{CD}$  again at  $Z$ . Additionally, let  $O_1$  be the center of  $(ADX)$  and  $O_2$  be the center of  $(BCY)$ .
